    "titleText": {
      "es": "Los expertos siguen debatiendo si el periodo actual es pos-posmoderno o neo-contemporáneo.",
      "en": "Scholars are still debating whether the current period is post-postmodern or neo-contemporary.",
      "noteEn": "The Spanish title and title text are preserved exactly from the Spanish archive, while the English fields reproduce official xkcd #3089. The raster mixes Spanish historical labels with the unchanged English label MID-CENTURY MODERN; those three English words and the four printed years are inventoried as nonlexical exclusions. OCR's isolated LL is tick-mark artwork rather than text and is omitted, while MID-CENTURY is split at its visible hyphen into two excluded words."
